## 6. External Use and IP Protection
The Software and any derivative works:
- **Must NOT be delivered or transferred in source code form** to any external customer or third party
- **Must NOT grant ownership, joint ownership, or IP rights** to any external party

The following uses are **explicitly permitted**, provided no IP ownership is transferred:
- Hosting the Software as part of a **Software-as-a-Service (SaaS)** or managed service
- Deploying compiled binaries or containers on customer infrastructure
- Using the Software to generate outputs, results, or services delivered to customers

Any exception involving source code disclosure or IP transfer requires **explicit prior written approval** from **FA.AI** and FPT Automotive management.

